failures: "3 guarded failure cases\nSee the recorded conditions and effects below" {
  link: "#process/interaction/publication"
  tooltip: "Admission, candidate or receipt validation fails.\nReject without authoritative task effects.\nPrivate temporary data is not current record authority.\n\nRevision/read basis conflicts or storage is busy.\nConflict or busy; caller rereads before deciding.\nWinning committed work remains authoritative.\n\nTransaction or response is interrupted.\nInspect coherent recovered state; never replay semantic task or infer success from missing output.\nSQLite establishes committed/uncommitted state; corrupt or unavailable state stops safely."
  style.fill: "#F9EEEE"
  style.stroke: "#597390"
  style.font-color: "#24364A"
  style.font-size: 16
  style.border-radius: 7
